@api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5245
@userEmail = testuser@example.com
@userPassword = Password123!
@accessToken = paste_access_token_here
@refreshToken = paste_refresh_token_here
@fixedExpenseId = paste_fixed_expense_id_here

### Register
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"email": "{{userEmail}}",
	"password": "{{userPassword}}"
}

### Login
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"email": "{{userEmail}}",
	"password": "{{userPassword}}"
}

### Refresh
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Get Todos (Authorized)
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Get Fixed Expenses (Authorized)
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/fixed-expenses
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create Fixed Expense (Authorized)
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/fixed-expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
	"name": "Internet",
	"amount": 89.99,
	"anchorDate": "2026-05-01",
	"recurrenceUnit": "Week",
	"recurrenceInterval": 6,
	"isActive": true
}

### Update Fixed Expense (Authorized)
PUT {{api_HostAddress}}/api/fixed-expenses/{{fixedExpenseId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
	"name": "Internet",
	"amount": 89.99,
	"anchorDate": "2026-05-01",
	"recurrenceUnit": "Week",
	"recurrenceInterval": 6,
	"isActive": true,
	"skipUntilDate": "2026-07-01"
}

### Delete Fixed Expense (Authorized)
DELETE {{api_HostAddress}}/api/fixed-expenses/{{fixedExpenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
